  - nodeId: sc_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Czwartek. Declan k\u0142adzie na desce ulotk\u0119: Dublin Institute of Technology, szko\u0142a kulinarna przy Cathal Brugha Street. Kursy wieczorowe."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Half the chefs in this city went through Cathal Brugha Street. A proper certificate, Kooba. I'll pay half. You pay half, so you'll turn up.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Po\u0142owa wpisowego to osiemdziesi\u0105t euro. Dwa wieczory w tygodniu przez rok, po dwunastu godzinach w kuchni."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - certificate
    - half
    - pay
    - proper
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch3_stays_sink
    branchNodeId: sc_sink
    nextNodeId: sc_choice
  - nodeId: sc_sink
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Even for a man who likes his sink. A cert is a cert.
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
